WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Create your account. Confirm your email, then sign in with your email or username.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
After joining, use My SGC to find your purchases, access, meetings and personal library.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Browse learning material, kits and support. Each product shows its own price and purchase options.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Explore available resources. Start includes general learning material; additional products are sold separately.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Choose a module, open a lesson and work through teaching, notes and quizzes where included. Access depends on your purchase.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Bounce ideas around, join niche conversations, ask questions and find confidence and inspiration.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Find your meetings, purchased kits, quiz results and saved learning portfolio in My SGC.

